      "id": "claim_a45c48234c124280b68f28f709ab53dc",
      "statement": "Every collaborator carries permission edges (user edges naming the sharer, shareKey edges naming the link); the effective role is the maximum role reachable from the owner through valid edges, each edge granting min(edge role, sharer's effective role), with the owner as the implicit build root never stored in the collaborators table — computed live, never denormalized, and re-derived at every open().",
      "evidence": [
